    "https://snc.edu/academics/support/career-development": {
      "title": "Career Development",
      "description": "Career development resources | St. Norbert College Skip to main content Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request info Apply Visit Give Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request Info Apply Now Visit SNC Give Today Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore Career Development Career preparation from your first year on campus It’s never too early to start thinking about your post-graduate plans and our team at the Academic Advising & Career Development Center (AACD) is here to help you right from the first year. Whether it’s choosing a major or minor, finding a great internship or looking for work that aligns with your passions and interests, our team can assist. Work with your career counselor to: Explore career and major options through one-on-one appointments and assessments Discover jobs, graduate schools and internships Develop a resume, cover letter, and professional statement Practice interviewing Network with employers through career fairs or job shadowing opportunities More on Career Development \"Beyond just the curriculum required for pharmacy school, SNC gave me multiple paths to choose from. I was able to decide what I truly wanted to do with my life and from that my faculty advisors and professors helped lead me down the correct path in order to reach my goals.\" - Everett Burns ’26 Statistics & Outcomes Land a meaningful internship Need help finding an internship? No problem! Employers and graduate school admission committees alike look for people with experience — we're here to help you get it. Our career counselors will help you explore internship opportunities so you can discover potential careers and expand your professional network. Helpful resources at every stage For employers Reach out to our team to learn more about recruitment opportunities and ways to engage with our students through career development events and sponsorship. For example, in 2026, we're launching the SNC Career Combine – an event that gives student-athletes mock interview experience with local employers and also provides these companies with the chance to recruit up-and-coming talent for jobs and internships. For alumni Whether you graduated 3 months or 3 years ago, the AACD Center is here to help you with career assistance in any situation – changing careers, returning to graduate school, re-entering the workforce or other. SNC can also help you find the right Green Knight for your organization – from interns to full-time employees! Our alumni know the quality caliber of SNC graduates! For families We are here to help your student succeed by fostering awareness of career development as a lifelong and dynamic process. Our team provides opportunities for career assessment, exploration and preparation. Our goal is to help your students discover their unique combination of interests, talents, experiences and values. Contact info Academic Advising & Career Development Center 100 Grant Street | De Pere, WI 54115 920-403-3040 careers@snc.edu Request info Apply Visit Give Apply Now Location 100 Grant Street De Pere, WI 54115 Visit Popular links News Events mySNC Bookstore Next steps Request info Apply Visit Give TITLE IX NON-DISCRIMINATION HUMAN RESOURCES PRIVACY STATEMENT CONTACT US SITE ACCESSIBILITY"
    },
    "https://snc.edu/news/pressrelease/career-and-major-exploration-day-st-norbert-college": {
      "title": "Career and Major Exploration Day",
      "description": "Career and Major Exploration Day at St. Norbert College | St. Norbert College Skip to main content Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request info Apply Visit Give Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request Info Apply Now Visit SNC Give Today Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore PRESS RELEASE Career and Major Exploration Day at St. Norbert College Posted on Oct. 17, 2010 St. Norbert College is hosting a Career and Major Exploration Day on Tuesday, Oct. 26 from 3 to 4:30 p.m. in the Van Den Heuvel Family Campus Center Gymnasium located on the second floor. The event is for St. Norbert students and alumni. There will be a wide variety of employers on hand for students to network with, explore different career fields, learn about internships and job leads. A list of employer representatives can be found at http://www.snc.edu/career/students/cnd.html . Also, all St. Norbert College majors will be represented by upperclassmen so underclassmen can learn more about the over 40 majors St. Norbert has to offer. For more information, contact Jenny Schroth at 920-403-3040 or jenny.schroth@snc.edu . Contact info News & Events St. Norbert College 920-403-3048 communications@snc.edu Submit an Idea Media Inquiries Related News Press release St. Norbert College among 2026-2027… Read the article Press release New transfer agreement creates… Read the article Press release St. Norbert College ranks in top… Read the article Loading... Request info Apply Visit Give Apply Now Location 100 Grant Street De Pere, WI 54115 Visit Popular links News Events mySNC Bookstore Next steps Request info Apply Visit Give TITLE IX NON-DISCRIMINATION HUMAN RESOURCES PRIVACY STATEMENT CONTACT US SITE ACCESSIBILITY"
    },
    "https://snc.edu/news/pressrelease/st-norbert-college-host-career-and-internship-fair": {
      "title": "St. Norbert College to Host Career and Internship Fair",
      "description": "St. Norbert College to Host Career and Internship Fair | St. Norbert College Skip to main content Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request info Apply Visit Give Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request Info Apply Now Visit SNC Give Today Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore PRESS RELEASE St. Norbert College to Host Career and Internship Fair Posted on Aug. 14, 2017 Dozens of regional and national employers will come together at St. Norbert College on Thursday, Sept. 14 from 4 to 6:30 p.m. in Michels Commons Ballroom on the St. Norbert College campus for the Fall Career and Internship Fair. Employers seeking candidates for full-time and internship positions can register at http://www.snc.edu/go/hireaknight . The cost is $150 per table for private sector firms. Payment and registration deadline is Sept. 1. For more information, call 920-403-3040 or email careers@snc.edu . Contact info News & Events St. Norbert College 920-403-3048 communications@snc.edu Submit an Idea Media Inquiries Related News Press release St. Norbert College among 2026-2027… Read the article Press release New transfer agreement creates… Read the article Press release St. Norbert College ranks in top… Read the article Loading... Request info Apply Visit Give Apply Now Location 100 Grant Street De Pere, WI 54115 Visit Popular links News Events mySNC Bookstore Next steps Request info Apply Visit Give TITLE IX NON-DISCRIMINATION HUMAN RESOURCES PRIVACY STATEMENT CONTACT US SITE ACCESSIBILITY"
    },
    "https://snc.edu/news/pressrelease/st-norbert-college-host-annual-career-and-internship-fair": {
      "title": "St. Norbert College to Host Annual Career and Internship Fair",
      "description": "St. Norbert College to Host Annual Career and Internship Fair | St. Norbert College Skip to main content Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request info Apply Visit Give Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Helpful info for Current students Parents & families Visitors Alumni Business & community Request Info Apply Now Visit SNC Give Today Academics Undergraduate programs Graduate programs Schneider Business School Faculty Statistics & outcomes Global experiences Support Admissions Visit Apply Tuition Why SNC? Resources Financial aid Aid application Financial aid types Tuition calculator Your offer Forms Scholarships Athletics About SNC Leadership Faculty Student life Mission & traditions Our values History & heritage Popular Searches Events Careers Academic calendar Library Bookstore PRESS RELEASE St. Norbert College to Host Annual Career and Internship Fair Posted on Jan. 15, 2014 St. Norbert College will host its annual Career and Internship Fair Tuesday, Feb. 25, 3-5 p.m. in Michels Commons Ballroom (2nd floor) on the St. Norbert College campus. Employers seeking candidates for full-time and internship positions can register at https://www.myinterfase.com/snc/employer/ . The cost is $100 per table for private-sector firms, and $50 for government and nonprofit agencies. The deadline to register is Tuesday, Feb. 18. For more information, call 920-403-3040, email careers@snc.edu , or go to http://www.snc.edu/careers/employers/events/internshipfair.html . Contact info News & Events 